      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.9,
      "end_seconds": 8.56,
      "duration_seconds": 7.66,
      "text": "okay, so doctor, hi, where would you like me to put my coat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.73,
      "end_seconds": 14.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Yes, come in and sit down. What brings you here today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.98,
      "end_seconds": 22.33,
      "duration_seconds": 6.35,
      "text": "Honestly, it's sneezing in spring, and and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.45,
      "end_seconds": 29.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.72,
      "end_seconds": 36.0,
      "duration_seconds": 5.28,
      "text": "Two days, I think... sorry, ten days, I got that wrong."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.18,
      "end_seconds": 46.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.79,
      "end_seconds": 59.35,
      "duration_seconds": 11.56,
      "text": "Antihistamine helps a bit. Yes, pollen. That makes it worse. It happens a couple of times a week. I'd say severe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.03,
      "end_seconds": 63.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Have you had a runny itchy nose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.04,
      "end_seconds": 66.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "yes, for one week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.32,
      "end_seconds": 85.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Have you noticed fever, wheeze or loss of smell?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.0,
      "end_seconds": 89.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "no, not a single one"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.9,
      "end_seconds": 94.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.43,
      "end_seconds": 97.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.32,
      "end_seconds": 107.74,
      "duration_seconds": 9.42,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.3,
      "end_seconds": 110.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "No known allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.23,
      "end_seconds": 131.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.81,
      "end_seconds": 136.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.34,
      "end_seconds": 142.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Alright, tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.92,
      "end_seconds": 149.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.48,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.51,
      "end_seconds": 170.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.48,
      "end_seconds": 174.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "High cholesterol, for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.43,
      "end_seconds": 178.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "Right, right. Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.69,
      "end_seconds": 194.24,
      "duration_seconds": 14.55,
      "text": "Rosuvastatin. I take it 10 milligrams, at night for my cholesterol. I took the morning off to come in today. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.34,
      "end_seconds": 198.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.17,
      "end_seconds": 202.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "no, um, never"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.66,
      "end_seconds": 220.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.11,
      "end_seconds": 233.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "okay, this won't take long.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.13,
      "end_seconds": 263.72,
      "duration_seconds": 12.59,
      "text": "okay: height 153 centimetres, weight 53 kilos and heart rate 70, temp 36.8 degrees, BP is 119 over 81, BMI works out to 22.6."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.77,
      "end_seconds": 267.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "is that alright, you know, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.71,
      "end_seconds": 272.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "I'll interpret them after the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.14,
      "end_seconds": 278.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "okay, time for me to examine you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.12,
      "end_seconds": 282.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.32,
      "end_seconds": 300.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "The inside of the nose is pale and boggy with clear mucus."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.26,
      "end_seconds": 325.82,
      "duration_seconds": 22.56,
      "text": "okay, you can sit up now putting it all together, this is probably seasonal allergic rhinitis shower after being outdoors and keep windows shut when pollen is high come back if not better in a month can you tell me the plan back in your own words, so so I know I've explained it clearly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 330.91,
      "end_seconds": 337.36,
      "duration_seconds": 6.45,
      "text": "So, I come back if not better in a month. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.37,
      "end_seconds": 342.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 342.8,
      "end_seconds": 345.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Alright, thanks, take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.67,
      "end_seconds": 348.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Okay, goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
